  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Expression Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundacin Gran Chaco (FGCH) in Argentina will work with the Cooperativa Mujeres Artesanas del Gran Chaco, comprising Wichi and Qomle&apos;ec artisans from eight associations, to develop a new line of handbags, belts, blankets, rugs and clothing and assess the feasibility of marketing its brand in niche markets in Argentina and abroad. Training in design, handling new materials and technologies, quality control and marketing should increase income and improve the cooperative&apos;s effectiveness in serving the artisans. The project will benefit 1,200 artisans directly and will reach another 6,000 individuals indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
